{"product_id":"nasty-juice-wicked-haze-e-liquid","title":"Nasty Juice Wicked Haze E Liquid","description":"\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eWicked Haze shortfill e-liquid is inspired by a popular beverage; with ripe notes of blackcurrants and a zesty lemonade flavour, you'll find a tangy and tart fruit taste throughout. This is finished off with a low mint, to give you a cooling menthol taste that ties everything together.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eWicked Haze 50ml e-liquid is available as a 70% VG, 50ml shortfill, ideal for sub ohm vaping. Should you wish to vape with nicotine, we'd recommend you add a 10ml nic shot of your choice.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eBrought to you by Nasty Juice; a Malaysian based e-liquid brand passionate about creating high-end, authentic tasting flavours at affordable prices. Their shortfill range features fresh, fruity and clean flavour notes in a high VG mix, so you can be sure to create big clouds with an even bigger flavour!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e50ml of E-liquid in a 60ml Shortfill Bottle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLow Mint Series by Nasty Juice\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDouble Fruity Series by Nasty Juice\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSpace For a 10ml Nic Shot\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e70% VG \/ 30% PG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDesigned for Sub Ohm Vaping\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in Malaysia\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChildproof Cap\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTamper Evident Seal\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRecyclable Bottle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nasty","offers":[{"title":"3MG","offer_id":41652564262967,"sku":"Nasty Juice Wicked Haze 3 mg","price":1499.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"6MG","offer_id":41652564295735,"sku":"Nasty Juice Wicked Haze 6 mg","price":1499.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/nasty-juice-wicked-haze-eliquid-shortfill-bottle-with-box.jpg?v=1746639871","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/nasty-juice-wicked-haze-e-liquid","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




